  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;<br><span>For everyone looking for timeless jewelry design, the jewelry brand KOSAE from Berlin offers a diverse repertoire of designer jewelry for everyone: earrings, necklaces and bracelets with modern designs. The delicate works of the Berlin jewelry label fascinate with their unique and extraordinary patterns.&nbsp;<br></span><span>Behind KOSAE is primarily Hendrike Roers, a trained goldsmith and studied designer. Together with her team and her passion for design as a jewelry designer, she creates complex patterns for modern jewelry in trendy Berlin.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): &nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">designed and produced in Berlin</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">designer jewellery - timeless and exceptional in KOSAE's unique style</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">our social philosophy - collaboration with a workshop for mentally ill people</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">award-winning design: German Design Award 2023&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n<p>large selection of colors and materials:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>matte gold (goldplated)</li>\r\n<li>shiny gold (goldplated)</li>\r\n<li>matte rose gold (rosegold plated</li>\r\n<li>shiny rose gold (rosegold plated</li>\r\n<li>silver-colored (stainless steel)</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong>black (powder-coated)</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong>blue (powder-coated)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>✓ waterproof<br>✓ earhooks nickelfree&nbsp;(hypoallergenic)<br><strong>✓ lightweight earrings - comfortable to wear</strong></li>\r\n</ul>",
